1. WHAT THIS COVERS

The source code, design, text and original content of Jìyì (the "Work"),
including app.js, index.html, sw.js, manifest.webmanifest, the icons,
README.md, the program code in pinyin-auto.js, and the English glosses,
example sentences, translations and notes in decks.js.

It does not cover the third-party material listed in section 4.


2. WHAT YOU MAY DO

- Use the app at the address where the copyright holder publishes it, for your
  own learning.
- Read the source code, and fork it on GitHub to the extent GitHub's Terms of
  Service allow.
- Export, import and keep your own cards and study data. Your cards are yours.


3. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO WITHOUT WRITTEN PERMISSION

- Copy, modify, merge, publish, host, distribute, sublicense or sell the Work
